BUT the new comment says "jobParams first, then the project config (same override-before-default priority every machineSm knob uses)" — the comment's ORDER claim (jobParams first) contradicts both its own "override-before-default" framing and the machineSm precedent (override = project config first). So it's a comment/documentation error inside the module — the behavior is right, the stated precedence is backwards. That's a SUGESTION (docstring fix), since behavior matches the established pattern.

